  "mechanistic_diagnosis": [
    "The exact transpose W@(Phi*b) is only a transport operator. Its state is seeded by target-free learned local sources and is trained only indirectly through the forward predictor; it is not an adjoint of the unknown endpoint residual and imposes no global consistency condition on the correction trajectory.",
    "M therefore adds a second expressive feature path rather than solving a smoothing problem. The gross paired movement is large but 98.699% cancels, the fold sign is 2-2, and ordinary rows reverse the gain on the four persistent failures.",
    "Its endpoint tie is especially misleading: M regresses J at every layer L3-L14, peaks at L13, then cancels 95.27% of that mean regression in L14-L15. This is not a trajectory-wide reduction.",
    "All four >1e-7 breaches survive exactly. M is 3.234x above the 1e-8 raw target, so scaling this free backward latent path is not a credible route to the required 69.1% reduction."
  ],
  "node": "P2R0F2M",
  "one_frozen_successor": {
    "architecture": {
      "covariance_operator": "Let ahat_(i,k) be the 16 per-unit log-eigenvalue heads and abar_k=mean_i ahat_(i,k), a deterministic width mean. Then d_i=clamp(softplus(logd_i)+2^-12,2^-10,2^6), lambda_k=clamp(softplus(abar_k)+2^-12,2^-10,2^6), and C_l=diag(d_l)+U_l diag(lambda_l)U_l^T/W. C is never materialized as W x W.",
      "covariance_rank": 16,
      "deterministic_whitening": "G_l=V_l^T V_l/W+2^-10 I; U_l=V_l G_l^-1/2 using a symmetric 16x16 eigendecomposition with eigenvalues floored at 2^-10. No randomized sketch, pivot, tolerance, or sign choice.",
      "factor_transport": "P_l=Phi_l*(U_(l-1)@W_l) for l>2; P_2=0. This is one exact rank-16 full-width forward transport per transition.",
      "factor_update": "s_l=tanh(factor_head_l) is dimensionless and V_l=(gain_l*P_l)@M_l+s_l, with gain in [0.75,1.25] and M_l=I+0.10*tanh(mix_delta_l).",
      "global_cross_unit_update": "qhat_l=tanh(score_head_l) and delta_l=R_l*C_l*qhat_l = R_l[d_l*qhat_l+U_l{lambda_l*(U_l^T qhat_l/W)}]. This is the only new reported residual path.",
      "lawful_local_features": "Reuse J's 36 target-free raw20/sigma, four signed-message, four energy, and four coherence-derived local features.",
      "layer_heads": "For L2:L15, a layer-specific 34-vector head emits 16 factor innovations s, 16 log factor eigenvalues, one log diagonal variance, and one signed local dimensionless score qhat per unit.",
      "local_encoder": "shared 36->128->128 SiLU",
      "new_parameters": 86188,
      "physical_scale": "R_l is the outer-fit-only layer RMS already used by J. U, s, d, lambda, and qhat are dimensionless; the physical covariance is Sigma_l=R_l^2[diag(d_l)+U_l diag(lambda_l)U_l^T/W], the physical score is q_l=qhat_l/R_l, and delta_l=Sigma_l q_l.",
      "reported_correction": "J correction plus delta_l at every layer; no mixture, selector, hard-row gate, or post-metric fusion.",
